Subject: Welcome to IABSD 0.1 the AI-enhanced BSD !

AIBSD.fr is a fork of OpenBSD-7.9 that includes AI-generated
patches for ext4fs (Linux filesystem with journalling support)
and bluetooth accepted. These patches were rejected from OpenBSD
on a disability to respect copyright from AI generated source code.

In France we can copyright derivative work if it is transformed a
certain number of times. We state that the LLMs we use do transform
all their input more than 100x so it should be enough to make it a
new form of copyright.

RTFM !

$ man man
q
$ man afterboot
q

Choose a mirror URL from
 https://www.iabsd.fr/ftp.html

and store it into the file
 /etc/installurl.

To install packages :
 # pkg_add -v git rsync chromium emacs--no_x11

Official website :
 https://www.IABSD.fr

The official OpenBSD documentation applies too :
 https://www.OpenBSD.org

